Package: qore-zmq-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-zmq-module-doc
Description: ZeroMQ messaging and draft socket APIs for Qore
 Native bindings for ZeroMQ contexts, sockets, messages, frames and CURVE
 security, including CLIENT/SERVER and RADIO/DISH draft APIs. The package
 includes compiler metadata and private draft-enabled libzmq/CZMQ libraries.

