Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-zmq-module
Description: API reference and tests for Qore's ZeroMQ module
 HTML API reference and local messaging tests for ZeroMQ contexts, socket
 patterns, frames, messages, draft socket types and cryptographic operations.
